Gate G (M6 spec 16): a CLOSED profile made only of DXF LINEs -- a 60 x 40
999
rectangle at the origin. Deliberately drawn with the sides in a NON-sequential
999
order and with two of them reversed, because a real DXF has no obligation to
999
list a loop in traversal order or in a consistent direction. The profile
999
validator has to find the loop; the importer must not be relied on to hand it
999
over pre-sorted.
999

999
Analytical oracle: 60 x 40 x 20 = 48000 mm^3, and at 2700 kg/m^3 that is
999
0.1296 kg.
